    "∵∠ABC+∠ACB+∠1=180°，",
    "∴∠ABC+∠ACB=180°-∠1，",
    "∴∠OBC+∠OCB=\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)（∠ABC+∠ACB）=\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)（180°-∠1）=90°-\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)∠1，",
    "∴∠BOC=180°-∠OBC-∠OCB=180°-（90°-\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)∠1）=90°+\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)∠1，",
    "∵∠ACD=∠ABC+∠1，CE平分∠ACD，",
    "∴∠ECD=\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)∠ACD=\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)（∠ABC+∠1），",
    "∵∠ECD=∠OBC+∠2，",
    "∴∠2=\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)∠1，即∠1=2∠2，",
    "∴∠BOC=90°+\\(\\frac { 1 } { 2 }\\)∠1=90°+∠2，",
